.TH OMORFOS\-CLIPBOARD 1 "" omorfos "omorfos manual"
.nh
.ad l
.ds AD l
.SH NAME
omorfos\-clipboard \- Keeps what is copied in the omorfos desktop after the program it was copied from closes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBomorfos\-clipboard\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The omorfos compositor starts it, with the role that lets it keep the clipboard.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
Print this help
.TP
\fB\-V, \-\-version\fR
Print the version
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBomorfos\fR(1), \fBomorfosctl\fR(1), \fBomorfos\-config\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-keys\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-rules\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-menu\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-theme\fR(5)
